<item>
<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-22T22:38:33.798Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 22:38:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;RSF drones have struck near Khartoum, killing four people and damaging a United Nations building, while separate drone attacks have hit a residential area and another UN facility in the capital. The Rapid Support Forces continue ground offensives, including attacks on aid offices in Nyala and a shelter in West Kordofan that caused civilian casualties. Humanitarian conditions are worsening as charity kitchens in Khartoum close and displaced Sudanese, especially the elderly, face severe hardship. The conflict produced 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/west-bank-attacks-opposition-leader-eisenkot-decries-jewish-terrorism&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/90cec5dc-f699-4966-886d-6277cc289ed0?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261122-israel-s-eisenkot-slams-jewish-terrorism-after-attacks-by-settlers-in-west-bank&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/22/israeli-settlers-attack-multiple-palestinian-villages-as-pogroms-surge?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/11/22/west-bank-four-palestinian-villages-targeted-in-suspected-settler-attacks&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/22/netanyahu-rival-condemns-settler-arson-attacks-palestinian-villages-west-bank&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/israel-investigates-west-bank-fires&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.washingtonpost.com/world/2026/11/22/arson-attacks-by-israeli-settlers-west-bank-add-tense-political-debate/&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
